    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Isaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyafikaga itungo i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamuwi'la Sala, wamwizi'i'laga na ku'mugelani'zi'zya ilagano ki'ti' i'vyo ndi' wayomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Sala wav'aga na mwitungo. Aho lyafikaga itungo lya ku'v'yala wamuv'yali'laga Abalahamu mwana wa ki'gosya mu wu'kiku'lu' wakwe, mu itungo lyeni'lo ki'ti' i'vyo ndi' wawi'lwa na Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu wamupaga lina Isaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Isaka” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ali'seka.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", mwana u'yo wamuv'yali'laga Sala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka aho wafikyaga musimo gwa nsiku' munane, Abalahamu wamuputaga nyu'nzu' yakwe ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu wamupile ilagi'li'zyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lya ku'v'yalwa ku'mwa Isaka, Abalahamu ise wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Sala wayombaga, “Mulungu wambezyaga ntogwe na ku'seka, na ki'la muntu' u'yo akwigwa muhayo gwenu'gu' aku'seka haki'mo nanne.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' walambaga ku'yomba, “Nde wali' alamuwi'le Abalahamu ati' Sala muki' wakwe alonsye mwana? Ali'vi gi'si' namuv'yali'laga mwana wa ki'gosya mu wu'kiku'lu' wakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'sagwa kwamwa Hajili na Isumaili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka waku'laga, na Sala wamupeezyaga iv'ele. Mu lu'siku' lwenu'lo Abalahamu wav'ezyaga mwanya muhanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Sala wamuwonaga Isumaili mwana wamwa Abalahamu u'yo wamuv'yali'lile Hajili, Mumisili, ali'muv'ezezya mansyente Isaka mwana wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo, Sala wamuwi'laga Abalahamu, “U'musage muzya mwenu'yu' haki'mo na mwane, ku'nguno yi'kakowoleka mwana wa muzya ku'saala haki'mo na mwana wanne Isaka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhayo gwenu'go gwav'aga muv'i muno ku'mwa Abalahamu ku'nguno ya mwane Isumaili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abalahamu, “Muhayo gwenu'go waku'wi'laga Sala gu'leke ku'v'a muv'i ku' wako, ku'nguno ya muzya wako na mwana wakwe Isumaili. Degelekaga i'cho aku'ku'wi'la, ku'nguno wu'v'yalwa wako wu'ligele ku'fumi'i'la ku' mwana wako Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa mwana wa muzya wako, mwene ndamuv'ezye av'e v'av'a wa kabi'la ku'nguno mwenu'yu' nawe ali' mwana wako du'.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wangalu'ke ndiyu' Abalahamu wasolaga viliwa na ki'kondo cha minzi', na wamuv'agali'ki'zyaga Hajili na ku'musinia haki'mo na mwane. Nav'o v'awu'kaga na v'alondaga ku' ibalangu' lya Beeli-sheba na kwenu'ko wayegayegaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga aho gamalaga minzi' ga mu ki'kondo, Hajili wamulekaga mwane Isumaili ha nsi'li'li' na isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wayaga ha mpelo, wu'lihu wa ki'ti' ntambo igana li'mo, na wayombaga mu moyo gwakwe, “Yi'kav'ile visoga mmuwone mwana wanne aho ali'fwa.” Yav'aga aho wikalaga kwenu'ko, wali'laga ku' muzwi muhanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana nawe wali'laga, na Mulungu wigagwa ku'li'la kwakwe. Haho malaika wamwa Mulungu ku'fuma ku' ilunde wamwitanaga Hajili na wamuwu'zyaga, “Hajili ku'li' na ki'? Ku'du' wogohe, ku'nguno Mulungu wigagwa ki'li'lo cha mwana wako kwenu'ko ali'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wu'kaga u'ye ku' mwana wako u'kamuwu'sye, na u'mudime mukono, ku'nguno ndamuv'ezye av'e v'av'a wa kabi'la nhanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamufumbu'laga minso gakwe Hajili, nawe walu'wonaga lwinzi', wayaga ku'kadaha mu ki'kondo, wokazyaga minzi' na wamunywisyaga mwana wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulungu wav'aga haki'mo na mwana mwenu'yo, nawe wendeleyaga ku'ku'la, wav'aga mwikazi wa mu ibalangu', na wav'aga mulasi wa masonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lyeni'lo lya wikalo wakwe mu ibalangu' lya Palani, nnina wamukoov'elaga muki'ma wa Ki'misili na wamutozyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu na Abimeleki v'ali'lagana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
