          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe mutemi Abimeleki na Fikoli, muhanya wa v'asilikale, v'ayaga ku'mwa Abalahamu na v'amuwi'laga ati', “Mulungu ali' haki'mo nanho ku' ki'la igambo i'lo u'li'v'ezya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo u'lahi'le ku' lina lyamwa Mulungu, ku'v'a u'kasye u'mbezezye wu'yengani, ene, v'ana v'anne, na wu'v'yalwa wanne. Ki'ti' i'vi ene naku'v'ezezizye chelu', nanho u'mbezezye chelu' cheni'cho, ene na nsi' yeni'yi' i'yo wikalile ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Abalahamu wasu'v'yaga, “Nu'lahi'la.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Abalahamu wasayaga ku'mwa Abimeleki ku'nguno ya lwinzi' lwa minzi' u'lo v'akumba v'amwa Abimeleki ndi' v'amupuzya Abalahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Abimeleki wayombaga, “Ene nkamanya nde wav'ezizye vyeni'vyo, ninga nanho u'kambwi'lile, na muhayo gwenu'gu' hu' nu'gwigwa walelo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Abalahamu wasolaga madale ga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li, na wamupaga Abimeleki, nav'o v'enav'a v'av'i'li' v'av'ezyaga ilagano lyav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Abalahamu wakomaga tu'di'lana tu'ki'ma mupungati' twa nkolo, na watu'tu'u'laga twinene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Abimeleki wamuwu'zyaga Abalahamu ati', “ku' ki' watu'koma twenu'tu' tu'di'lana mupungati'?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nu'ku'pa twenu'tu' tu'di'lana mupungati', u'tu'sole ku'fuma mu makono ganne ki'gele wu'v'e wu'sangi'lwa wa ene nanho ku'v'a lwinzi' lwenu'lu' ene hu' ndu'si'mbile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho lwinzi' lwenu'lo v'alu'paga lina “Beeli-sheba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Muhayo “Beeli-sheba” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo yi'li' “lwinzi' lwa mulahi'” ninga “lwinzi' lwa av'o mupungati'.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",” ku'nguno v'ilahi'li'zyaga henanho v'ose v'av'i'li'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho v'amali'laga ku'v'ezya ilagano lyav'o kwenu'ko ku' lwandi' lwa Beeli-sheba, Abimeleki na Fikoli, muhanya wa v'asilikale, v'awu'kaga kwenu'ko, na v'asu'v'aga ku' nsi' ya V'afilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu muti' gwa mutaka kwenu'ko ku' Beeli-sheba, na wamwisengaga Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa nhananhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wikalaga kwenu'ko ku' lwandi' lwa V'afilisiti ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi ku' itungo ilihu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
